  body: "# Memo 07/20 removal recorded in official catalogue history\n\nExact frozen catalogue field:\n\
    \nAdded 'DMG memo 9/22: IS, SPC, IR ESA, IB JSA - Temporary cease on third party deduction request
    by fuel suppliers for ongoing consumption'. Removed 'DMG memo 7/20 Prisoners on temporary release'
    as the regulations ceased to have effect from 31 August 2021.\n\nThis is catalogue metadata, not acquisition
    or review of the linked document body. Frozen DMG research: listed legacy JSA(Cont), JSA(IB), IS,
    SPC and ESA(Cont)/ESA(IR) imprisonment guidance captured on 15 September 2026. This is an explanation
    of the captured text, not a determination of contemporary individual eligibility."
